Package: realm-river
Architecture: amd64
Provides: river (= 0.4.8)
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libinput-bin (>= 1.25.0)
Description: private River 0.4.8 runtime for Realm on Ubuntu Noble
 Feature-bearing River with Realm's pinned private Wayland, wlroots, DRM,
 input, rendering and Xwayland library closure. This pre-alpha package is
 built for Realm's Ubuntu 24.04 session and does not install /usr/bin/river.
